[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9720.79, "timestamp": "02:42:00", "text": "山越爬越高……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9724.23, "timestamp": "02:42:04", "text": "这座山，我们一起来。这是来自……的礼物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.99, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "隐藏的事物对我来说是一个障碍。啊，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.309, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "我大致明白她可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.309, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "它想让我退后一步，反思一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9738.71, "timestamp": "02:42:18", "text": "走了。但她把击中鳃的部位藏了起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9740.23, "timestamp": "02:42:20", "text": "这些地方。打扰您了，真抱歉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9743.83, "timestamp": "02:42:23", "text": "我也只是个共鸣器而已。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9745.75, "timestamp": "02:42:25", "text": "这里景色真美。一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9748.95, "timestamp": "02:42:28", "text": "来的人很少，但来的人也很少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9751.75, "timestamp": "02:42:31", "text": "来这里欣赏它。 Lex 工作效率低下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.27, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "把这次攀登当作一次……来对待也未尝不可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.78, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9769.23, "timestamp": "02:42:49", "text": "[掌声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9771.51, "timestamp": "02:42:51", "text": "移动。你知道你不能"}]